# Netscape HTTP Cookie File
# This is an EXAMPLE only. Replace with real Instagram cookies exported from
# your browser (use a "Get cookies.txt (Netscape)" extension while logged in).
#
# DO NOT COMMIT REAL COOKIES. Put them ONLY in a Render Secret File named
# "instagram_cookies.txt" (Dashboard -> Environment -> Secret Files), never here.
#
# Format: one cookie per line, TAB-separated:
# <domain>	<flag>	<path>	<secure>	<expiry>	<name>	<value>
#
.instagram.com	TRUE	/	TRUE	0	EXAMPLE_COOKIE_NAME	EXAMPLE_VALUE
